  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain.\n• Return saucepan to medium-high heat with the plant-based butter and a drizzle of olive oil. Cook garlic paste until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat then return potato and add the plant-based milk. Season generously with salt. Mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667b5a5b438760e4ef4144d8-0afd85f6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While potato is boiling, preheat grill to high.\n• Slice zucchini into thin half-moons.\n• Trim and roughly chop green beans.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667b5a5b438760e4ef4144d8-88d0c95c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook zucchini, green beans and soffritto mix, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium then add tomato paste, chermoula spice blend and lentils. Cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667b5a5b438760e4ef4144d8-df4e823c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To lentils, stir in coconut milk, the water, salt and a pinch of the brown sugar. Simmer, until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667b5a5b438760e4ef4144d8-0cfb2943.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer filling to a baking dish and evenly spread garlic mash potato over the top with a drizzle of olive oil. Sprinkle over Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until lightly golden, 8-10 minutes. TIP: Drizzling with olive oil helps the topping to crisp and brown!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667b5a5b438760e4ef4144d8-4dcffbd0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Moroccan lentil veggie and cheesy pie between plates.\n• Top with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667b5a5b438760e4ef4144d8-5958837a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
